B.Jc=new A.jj("Floating Logger","Floating Logger is an open-source Flutter library designed to simplify API debugging and testing during development. It provides an in-app floating logger that allows developers to monitor network requests in real time and quickly copy cURL commands for external testing.\n\nKey Features:\n- Clean and readable API debug console\n- Beautified JSON response viewer\n- Copy cURL command via long press\n- Floating action button for flexible access\n- Global enable/disable using preferences\n- Network condition simulation\n- Customizable log item list\n\nThis package is published on pub.dev and actively used by Flutter developers.",null,null,"https://pub.dev/packages/floating_logger","assets/floating_logger.png","1k+ Downloads",B.Ol,B.Pt)
